[{"id":"hook-00","text":"I’m going to give an AI agent a simple task.","start":15,"end":81,"words":[{"w":"I’m","f":17},{"w":"going","f":21},{"w":"to","f":30},{"w":"give","f":35},{"w":"an","f":42},{"w":"AI","f":47},{"w":"agent","f":52},{"w":"a","f":61},{"w":"simple","f":64},{"w":"task.","f":74}]},{"id":"hook-01","text":"Find my project brief and summarize it.","start":140,"end":194,"words":[{"w":"Find","f":142},{"w":"my","f":149},{"w":"project","f":154},{"w":"brief","f":164},{"w":"and","f":171},{"w":"summarize","f":177},{"w":"it.","f":189}]},{"id":"hook-02","text":"To do that, it needs to search the workspace and read a file.","start":232,"end":325,"words":[{"w":"To","f":234},{"w":"do","f":238},{"w":"that,","f":243},{"w":"it","f":255},{"w":"needs","f":260},{"w":"to","f":268},{"w":"search","f":273},{"w":"the","f":282},{"w":"workspace","f":288},{"w":"and","f":301},{"w":"read","f":307},{"w":"a","f":315},{"w":"file.","f":318}]},{"id":"hook-03","text":"But suppose the same agent also has access to a tool that can delete an entire folder.","start":390,"end":522,"words":[{"w":"But","f":392},{"w":"suppose","f":398},{"w":"the","f":410},{"w":"same","f":416},{"w":"agent","f":423},{"w":"also","f":432},{"w":"has","f":440},{"w":"access","f":446},{"w":"to","f":456},{"w":"a","f":461},{"w":"tool","f":465},{"w":"that","f":473},{"w":"can","f":480},{"w":"delete","f":487},{"w":"an","f":497},{"w":"entire","f":502},{"w":"folder.","f":512}]},{"id":"hook-04","text":"What happens if it calls that tool while working on my request?","start":592,"end":679,"words":[{"w":"What","f":594},{"w":"happens","f":600},{"w":"if","f":611},{"w":"it","f":615},{"w":"calls","f":620},{"w":"that","f":628},{"w":"tool","f":635},{"w":"while","f":642},{"w":"working","f":650},{"w":"on","f":660},{"w":"my","f":664},{"w":"request?","f":669}]},{"id":"hook-05","text":"I could read the agent’s chat and hope it tells me what it did.","start":739,"end":827,"words":[{"w":"I","f":741},{"w":"could","f":744},{"w":"read","f":752},{"w":"the","f":759},{"w":"agent’s","f":764},{"w":"chat","f":773},{"w":"and","f":780},{"w":"hope","f":786},{"w":"it","f":793},{"w":"tells","f":797},{"w":"me","f":805},{"w":"what","f":810},{"w":"it","f":817},{"w":"did.","f":821}]},{"id":"hook-06","text":"By then, the files could already be gone.","start":908,"end":968,"words":[{"w":"By","f":910},{"w":"then,","f":914},{"w":"the","f":925},{"w":"files","f":931},{"w":"could","f":939},{"w":"already","f":947},{"w":"be","f":957},{"w":"gone.","f":962}]},{"id":"hook-07","text":"That’s the problem we’re solving with Safe-Mode Gateway for Track 1.","start":1011,"end":1101,"words":[{"w":"That’s","f":1013},{"w":"the","f":1021},{"w":"problem","f":1026},{"w":"we’re","f":1037},{"w":"solving","f":1044},{"w":"with","f":1054},{"w":"Safe-Mode","f":1061},{"w":"Gateway","f":1073},{"w":"for","f":1084},{"w":"Track","f":1089},{"w":"1.","f":1098}]},{"id":"hook-08","text":"It gives people a way to control what their AI agents can actually do.","start":1147,"end":1245,"words":[{"w":"It","f":1149},{"w":"gives","f":1153},{"w":"people","f":1161},{"w":"a","f":1170},{"w":"way","f":1174},{"w":"to","f":1179},{"w":"control","f":1184},{"w":"what","f":1194},{"w":"their","f":1201},{"w":"AI","f":1209},{"w":"agents","f":1214},{"w":"can","f":1223},{"w":"actually","f":1229},{"w":"do.","f":1240}]},{"id":"how-00","text":"MCP lets an AI agent connect to tools like file search, cloud storage, or a database.","start":1365,"end":1511,"words":[{"w":"MCP","f":1373},{"w":"lets","f":1379},{"w":"an","f":1387},{"w":"AI","f":1392},{"w":"agent","f":1397},{"w":"connect","f":1406},{"w":"to","f":1418},{"w":"tools","f":1423},{"w":"like","f":1432},{"w":"file","f":1440},{"w":"search,","f":1448},{"w":"cloud","f":1463},{"w":"storage,","f":1473},{"w":"or","f":1489},{"w":"a","f":1495},{"w":"database.","f":1498}]},{"id":"how-01","text":"Safe-Mode Gateway sits between the agent and those tools.","start":1561,"end":1651,"words":[{"w":"Safe-Mode","f":1565},{"w":"Gateway","f":1578},{"w":"sits","f":1590},{"w":"between","f":1598},{"w":"the","f":1610},{"w":"agent","f":1617},{"w":"and","f":1626},{"w":"those","f":1633},{"w":"tools.","f":1642}]},{"id":"how-02","text":"Every tool call that goes through the gateway gets checked before it runs.","start":1678,"end":1780,"words":[{"w":"Every","f":1680},{"w":"tool","f":1688},{"w":"call","f":1695},{"w":"that","f":1701},{"w":"goes","f":1708},{"w":"through","f":1715},{"w":"the","f":1726},{"w":"gateway","f":1731},{"w":"gets","f":1742},{"w":"checked","f":1749},{"w":"before","f":1759},{"w":"it","f":1768},{"w":"runs.","f":1773}]},{"id":"how-03","text":"We classify calls in three groups.","start":1840,"end":1888,"words":[{"w":"We","f":1842},{"w":"classify","f":1846},{"w":"calls","f":1858},{"w":"in","f":1866},{"w":"three","f":1871},{"w":"groups.","f":1879}]},{"id":"how-04","text":"Read actions retrieve information.","start":1924,"end":1974,"words":[{"w":"Read","f":1926},{"w":"actions","f":1933},{"w":"retrieve","f":1945},{"w":"information.","f":1957}]},{"id":"how-05","text":"Write actions change something, like renaming a file.","start":1985,"end":2059,"words":[{"w":"Write","f":1987},{"w":"actions","f":1995},{"w":"change","f":2005},{"w":"something,","f":2014},{"w":"like","f":2030},{"w":"renaming","f":2037},{"w":"a","f":2048},{"w":"file.","f":2052}]},{"id":"how-06","text":"Destructive actions can remove data, like deleting a folder.","start":2091,"end":2175,"words":[{"w":"Destructive","f":2093},{"w":"actions","f":2108},{"w":"can","f":2118},{"w":"remove","f":2124},{"w":"data,","f":2133},{"w":"like","f":2144},{"w":"deleting","f":2151},{"w":"a","f":2162},{"w":"folder.","f":2166}]},{"id":"how-07","text":"The operator sets the policy.","start":2208,"end":2257,"words":[{"w":"The","f":2210},{"w":"operator","f":2217},{"w":"sets","f":2231},{"w":"the","f":2239},{"w":"policy.","f":2246}]},{"id":"how-08","text":"In this demo, approved read tools run automatically.","start":2281,"end":2361,"words":[{"w":"In","f":2283},{"w":"this","f":2287},{"w":"demo,","f":2295},{"w":"approved","f":2307},{"w":"read","f":2320},{"w":"tools","f":2327},{"w":"run","f":2336},{"w":"automatically.","f":2342}]},{"id":"how-09","text":"A write or destructive action pauses for a decision.","start":2387,"end":2464,"words":[{"w":"A","f":2389},{"w":"write","f":2392},{"w":"or","f":2401},{"w":"destructive","f":2406},{"w":"action","f":2422},{"w":"pauses","f":2432},{"w":"for","f":2442},{"w":"a","f":2448},{"w":"decision.","f":2451}]},{"id":"how-10","text":"That means I can let the agent search ten files without clicking ten times, and still stop it at the moment it tries to change one.","start":2504,"end":2701,"words":[{"w":"That","f":2506},{"w":"means","f":2513},{"w":"I","f":2522},{"w":"can","f":2525},{"w":"let","f":2531},{"w":"the","f":2537},{"w":"agent","f":2544},{"w":"search","f":2552},{"w":"ten","f":2562},{"w":"files","f":2568},{"w":"without","f":2576},{"w":"clicking","f":2587},{"w":"ten","f":2599},{"w":"times,","f":2606},{"w":"and","f":2619},{"w":"still","f":2625},{"w":"stop","f":2634},{"w":"it","f":2641},{"w":"at","f":2646},{"w":"the","f":2651},{"w":"moment","f":2657},{"w":"it","f":2666},{"w":"tries","f":2671},{"w":"to","f":2680},{"w":"change","f":2685},{"w":"one.","f":2694}]},{"id":"allow-block-00","text":"Here’s the original task.","start":2865,"end":2903,"words":[{"w":"Here’s","f":2869},{"w":"the","f":2877},{"w":"original","f":2884},{"w":"task.","f":2896}]},{"id":"allow-block-01","text":"Find the project brief.","start":2931,"end":2963,"words":[{"w":"Find","f":2934},{"w":"the","f":2940},{"w":"project","f":2946},{"w":"brief.","f":2956}]},{"id":"allow-block-02","text":"The agent calls the search tool, the gateway allows it, and the brief comes back.","start":2997,"end":3119,"words":[{"w":"The","f":2999},{"w":"agent","f":3005},{"w":"calls","f":3013},{"w":"the","f":3021},{"w":"search","f":3027},{"w":"tool,","f":3036},{"w":"the","f":3048},{"w":"gateway","f":3054},{"w":"allows","f":3065},{"w":"it,","f":3074},{"w":"and","f":3084},{"w":"the","f":3089},{"w":"brief","f":3095},{"w":"comes","f":3104},{"w":"back.","f":3112}]},{"id":"allow-block-03","text":"Now I’ll trigger a delete request to show what happens when the agent asks for something riskier.","start":3195,"end":3342,"words":[{"w":"Now","f":3197},{"w":"I’ll","f":3203},{"w":"trigger","f":3209},{"w":"a","f":3221},{"w":"delete","f":3225},{"w":"request","f":3235},{"w":"to","f":3247},{"w":"show","f":3252},{"w":"what","f":3259},{"w":"happens","f":3267},{"w":"when","f":3279},{"w":"the","f":3286},{"w":"agent","f":3293},{"w":"asks","f":3302},{"w":"for","f":3310},{"w":"something","f":3316},{"w":"riskier.","f":3330}]},{"id":"allow-block-04","text":"The agent wants to delete the client-files folder.","start":3417,"end":3487,"words":[{"w":"The","f":3419},{"w":"agent","f":3425},{"w":"wants","f":3433},{"w":"to","f":3441},{"w":"delete","f":3446},{"w":"the","f":3456},{"w":"client-files","f":3462},{"w":"folder.","f":3477}]},{"id":"allow-block-05","text":"The gateway pauses the call before it reaches the file tool.","start":3531,"end":3616,"words":[{"w":"The","f":3533},{"w":"gateway","f":3539},{"w":"pauses","f":3549},{"w":"the","f":3559},{"w":"call","f":3565},{"w":"before","f":3572},{"w":"it","f":3581},{"w":"reaches","f":3586},{"w":"the","f":3596},{"w":"file","f":3602},{"w":"tool.","f":3609}]},{"id":"allow-block-06","text":"Look at the approval card.","start":3681,"end":3716,"words":[{"w":"Look","f":3683},{"w":"at","f":3689},{"w":"the","f":3693},{"w":"approval","f":3699},{"w":"card.","f":3710}]},{"id":"allow-block-07","text":"I can see the action, the exact folder it targets, and which agent requested it.","start":3759,"end":3878,"words":[{"w":"I","f":3761},{"w":"can","f":3764},{"w":"see","f":3770},{"w":"the","f":3776},{"w":"action,","f":3781},{"w":"the","f":3795},{"w":"exact","f":3801},{"w":"folder","f":3809},{"w":"it","f":3818},{"w":"targets,","f":3823},{"w":"and","f":3838},{"w":"which","f":3844},{"w":"agent","f":3852},{"w":"requested","f":3860},{"w":"it.","f":3873}]},{"id":"allow-block-08","text":"I know exactly what I’m being asked to approve.","start":3957,"end":4018,"words":[{"w":"I","f":3959},{"w":"know","f":3962},{"w":"exactly","f":3968},{"w":"what","f":3978},{"w":"I’m","f":3984},{"w":"being","f":3989},{"w":"asked","f":3996},{"w":"to","f":4004},{"w":"approve.","f":4008}]},{"id":"allow-block-09","text":"I’ll hit Deny.","start":4083,"end":4127,"words":[{"w":"I’ll","f":4085},{"w":"hit","f":4098},{"w":"Deny.","f":4111}]},{"id":"allow-block-11","text":"The folder is still here.","start":4209,"end":4247,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4211},{"w":"folder","f":4217},{"w":"is","f":4226},{"w":"still","f":4231},{"w":"here.","f":4240}]},{"id":"allow-block-12","text":"And in the activity log, you can see both events.","start":4287,"end":4365,"words":[{"w":"And","f":4297},{"w":"in","f":4302},{"w":"the","f":4306},{"w":"activity","f":4312},{"w":"log,","f":4323},{"w":"you","f":4333},{"w":"can","f":4338},{"w":"see","f":4344},{"w":"both","f":4349},{"w":"events.","f":4356}]},{"id":"allow-block-13","text":"The search ran.","start":4425,"end":4452,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4427},{"w":"search","f":4434},{"w":"ran.","f":4445}]},{"id":"allow-block-14","text":"The deletion was requested and denied before it could run.","start":4479,"end":4556,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4481},{"w":"deletion","f":4486},{"w":"was","f":4497},{"w":"requested","f":4503},{"w":"and","f":4515},{"w":"denied","f":4521},{"w":"before","f":4530},{"w":"it","f":4539},{"w":"could","f":4543},{"w":"run.","f":4551}]},{"id":"approve-undo-00","text":"Sometimes the agent is supposed to make a change.","start":4665,"end":4738,"words":[{"w":"Sometimes","f":4668},{"w":"the","f":4681},{"w":"agent","f":4687},{"w":"is","f":4696},{"w":"supposed","f":4701},{"w":"to","f":4713},{"w":"make","f":4718},{"w":"a","f":4725},{"w":"change.","f":4728}]},{"id":"approve-undo-01","text":"Here it’s asking to rename project-brief.md to final-brief.md.","start":4802,"end":4901,"words":[{"w":"Here","f":4805},{"w":"it’s","f":4814},{"w":"asking","f":4821},{"w":"to","f":4833},{"w":"rename","f":4839},{"w":"project-brief.md","f":4851},{"w":"to","f":4874},{"w":"final-brief.md.","f":4880}]},{"id":"approve-undo-02","text":"The card shows the current name and the proposed name, so I can see the change before I approve it.","start":4926,"end":5063,"words":[{"w":"The","f":4928},{"w":"card","f":4934},{"w":"shows","f":4940},{"w":"the","f":4948},{"w":"current","f":4954},{"w":"name","f":4964},{"w":"and","f":4970},{"w":"the","f":4976},{"w":"proposed","f":4981},{"w":"name,","f":4992},{"w":"so","f":5003},{"w":"I","f":5008},{"w":"can","f":5011},{"w":"see","f":5017},{"w":"the","f":5022},{"w":"change","f":5028},{"w":"before","f":5037},{"w":"I","f":5045},{"w":"approve","f":5049},{"w":"it.","f":5059}]},{"id":"approve-undo-03","text":"I’ll approve this one.","start":5208,"end":5241,"words":[{"w":"I’ll","f":5210},{"w":"approve","f":5216},{"w":"this","f":5227},{"w":"one.","f":5235}]},{"id":"approve-undo-04","text":"The gateway forwards the call, and the new filename appears in the workspace.","start":5280,"end":5384,"words":[{"w":"The","f":5282},{"w":"gateway","f":5288},{"w":"forwards","f":5297},{"w":"the","f":5308},{"w":"call,","f":5314},{"w":"and","f":5325},{"w":"the","f":5330},{"w":"new","f":5336},{"w":"filename","f":5341},{"w":"appears","f":5352},{"w":"in","f":5362},{"w":"the","f":5367},{"w":"workspace.","f":5372}]},{"id":"approve-undo-06","text":"Now imagine I approved too quickly.","start":5548,"end":5605,"words":[{"w":"Now","f":5556},{"w":"imagine","f":5562},{"w":"I","f":5573},{"w":"approved","f":5576},{"w":"too","f":5588},{"w":"quickly.","f":5594}]},{"id":"approve-undo-07","text":"This was still a draft.","start":5646,"end":5681,"words":[{"w":"This","f":5648},{"w":"was","f":5655},{"w":"still","f":5661},{"w":"a","f":5669},{"w":"draft.","f":5673}]},{"id":"approve-undo-08","text":"I can click Undo, and the gateway uses the recorded original filename to reverse the rename.","start":5731,"end":5871,"words":[{"w":"I","f":5733},{"w":"can","f":5736},{"w":"click","f":5743},{"w":"Undo,","f":5751},{"w":"and","f":5764},{"w":"the","f":5770},{"w":"gateway","f":5776},{"w":"uses","f":5788},{"w":"the","f":5795},{"w":"recorded","f":5801},{"w":"original","f":5814},{"w":"filename","f":5826},{"w":"to","f":5839},{"w":"reverse","f":5844},{"w":"the","f":5855},{"w":"rename.","f":5861}]},{"id":"approve-undo-09","text":"Undo depends on the action.","start":5960,"end":6007,"words":[{"w":"Undo","f":5962},{"w":"depends","f":5970},{"w":"on","f":5983},{"w":"the","f":5989},{"w":"action.","f":5996}]},{"id":"approve-undo-10","text":"A rename can be reversed when the file is still in the expected state.","start":6045,"end":6139,"words":[{"w":"A","f":6047},{"w":"rename","f":6050},{"w":"can","f":6059},{"w":"be","f":6064},{"w":"reversed","f":6069},{"w":"when","f":6080},{"w":"the","f":6086},{"w":"file","f":6092},{"w":"is","f":6098},{"w":"still","f":6103},{"w":"in","f":6111},{"w":"the","f":6115},{"w":"expected","f":6120},{"w":"state.","f":6131}]},{"id":"approve-undo-11","text":"An email that’s already been delivered may be impossible to take back.","start":6248,"end":6347,"words":[{"w":"An","f":6250},{"w":"email","f":6254},{"w":"that’s","f":6263},{"w":"already","f":6271},{"w":"been","f":6282},{"w":"delivered","f":6289},{"w":"may","f":6302},{"w":"be","f":6308},{"w":"impossible","f":6313},{"w":"to","f":6328},{"w":"take","f":6333},{"w":"back.","f":6340}]},{"id":"approve-undo-12","text":"The approval step is especially important for those actions.","start":6425,"end":6513,"words":[{"w":"The","f":6427},{"w":"approval","f":6433},{"w":"step","f":6446},{"w":"is","f":6453},{"w":"especially","f":6458},{"w":"important","f":6473},{"w":"for","f":6487},{"w":"those","f":6493},{"w":"actions.","f":6501}]},{"id":"audit-00","text":"If I hand this workspace to a teammate tomorrow, they can open the log and reconstruct the whole sequence.","start":6615,"end":6772,"words":[{"w":"If","f":6617},{"w":"I","f":6622}